  "private": true,
  "description": "Android app for Vietnamese commune health stations (Trạm y tế cấp xã) running the military-service health pre-screening (sơ tuyển) of Thông tư 105/2023/TT-BQP and Thông tư 106/2025/TT-BQP: scoring, statutory forms Mẫu 2, 2a and 2k as A4 PDFs, CCCD chip reading over NFC and Bluetooth LE weight scales. Offline, no network calls.",
